WEBVTT

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:05.135
Here's how to upload your photos and video to a shoot
in REPro Dashboard, and send everything

00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:06.170
to the editing team.

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:09.990
From your photographer dashboard, open the assigned
shoot.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.230
Check the property address, then find Raw Uploads.

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:16.830
Choose Upload Files, or Upload More if files are
already attached.

00:00:17.713 --> 00:00:21.643
Drag in your images or RAW files, or select them from
your computer.

00:00:21.873 --> 00:00:23.763
Match them to the correct booked service.

00:00:24.073 --> 00:00:26.063
Only services assigned to you are available.

00:00:26.913 --> 00:00:30.663
For bracketed photography, check the Bracket setting
matches what you captured.

00:00:30.933 --> 00:00:34.583
Check the selected count, and add any instructions in
Notes for Editor.

00:00:35.413 --> 00:00:39.403
Choose Confirm and upload, or Upload all for a batch
across services.

00:00:39.813 --> 00:00:42.403
Keep this browser tab open and wait for Upload
complete.

00:00:43.247 --> 00:00:48.357
To add video, choose Upload More, select your video
clips, and check the video service.

00:00:48.727 --> 00:00:50.337
Upload them and wait for completion.

00:00:50.827 --> 00:00:53.557
Use the matching service for drone and other booked
media.

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:56.350
Review the uploaded files and counts.

00:00:56.720 --> 00:01:00.530
If a file failed, retry it and confirm it appears
before continuing.

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:05.250
If a file is rejected, read the upload result and fix
the issue before retrying.

00:01:06.047 --> 00:01:09.057
When everything is attached, choose Submit Raw Files.

00:01:09.467 --> 00:01:12.457
Check the confirmation, then select Yes, submit.

00:01:12.807 --> 00:01:16.237
This sets the shoot status to Uploaded and notifies
the editing team.

00:01:16.947 --> 00:01:20.877
You're done. Upload first, review every file, then
submit.

00:01:21.247 --> 00:01:24.517
You can replay this guide from Upload guide on your
photographer dashboard.
